  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New server signing key: replies are verified against the new pinned key, so update to this version (1.4.0 cannot talk to the current server). 1.5.1: https://pwfauth.com is the only server address accepted. 1.5.2: a request that gets no reply at all (a dropped connection, Windows error 10054) is sent once more. 1.6.0: on networks that block the name pwfauth.com, requests reach the same server as pwfauth.net. See CHANGELOG.md.",
